DECL	{"args":[{"name":"x","sort":{"sort":"track"}}],"body":{"cmp":"le","lhs":{"args":[{"var":"x"}],"measure":"kin_speed"},"rhs":{"param":"speed_floor"}},"contract":"A road user is at a standstill at the observation. This is the corpus definition of a required stop, \"complete cessation from movement\", observed on sampled speeds: the road user's speed (kin.speed, m/s) is at or below speed_floor, the source's speed resolution, below which a reading counts as no movement. The state holds at each observation at which the speed is that low, with no minimum duration. Not denoted: where the road user stands, why it stands, or whether its engine runs or a brake is set.","definition":"DEF-NRS-484A-255","id":"drv.motion.halted","kind":"formula","narrowings":[],"params":[{"name":"speed_floor","unit":"metre_per_second"}],"residues":["The definition's scope words ('when required') say which duties it serves; the caller is the duty that requires the stop, so the concept carries no condition for them."],"supersedes":null}
ATOMS	kin_speed
READS	kin_speed
AGGREGATES	
HARDAGG	
BODY	{"cmp":"le","lhs":{"args":[{"var":"x"}],"measure":"kin_speed"},"rhs":{"param":"speed_floor"}}
WITNESS	holds	drv.motion.halted@w
WITNESS	fails	drv.motion.halted@w
WITNESS	blind	drv.motion.halted@w
OCC	x
INST	drv.motion.halted@w	ok
TIME	checks	2
TIME	lint	2
SCEN	holds	drv.motion.halted@w	compliant	compliant	ok
TIME	scenario:drv.motion.halted@w/holds	10
SCEN	fails	drv.motion.halted@w	violated	violated	ok
TIME	scenario:drv.motion.halted@w/fails	7
SCEN	blind	drv.motion.halted@w	unknown	unknown	ok
TIME	scenario:drv.motion.halted@w/blind	9
TIME	witnesses	26
DONE_WITNESSES
'TrafficSpec.Concepts.motion.halted.concept' does not depend on any axioms
